# AIMS - AI Media Storage
# ComfyUI Custom Node Dependencies
#
# These are already bundled with ComfyUI:
#   - torch >= 2.0.0
#   - numpy
#   - folder_paths (ComfyUI built-in)
#
# Required companion nodes:
#   - ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper (for WANVIDIMAGE_EMBEDS / WANVIDEOTEXTEMBEDS types)
#     https://github.com/purzbeats/ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper
#
# No additional pip packages required.
